
# Test Directory

This directory is intended for PlatformIO Test Runner and project tests.

Unit Testing is a software testing method by which individual units of
source code, sets of one or more MCU program modules together with associated
control data, usage procedures, and operating procedures, are tested to
determine whether they are fit for use. Unit testing finds problems early
in the development cycle.

More information about PlatformIO Unit Testing:

- <https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html>

Arquivos de regressao adicionados:

- `mqtt-regressao-checklist.md`: roteiro de teste MQTT (conexao, publish, subscribe e persistencia).
- `mqtt-payloads-exemplo.json`: payloads de referencia para comandos/validacao MQTT.
- `node-red-opcua-flow.json`: fluxo Node-RED para criar servidor OPC UA a partir do PubSub MQTT.
- `node-red-opcua-reader-flow.json`: fluxo Node-RED para ler dados do servidor OPC UA via cliente.
- `test-opcua-read.py`: script Python de diagnóstico para ler os nós do servidor OPC UA diretamente.
- `modbus-read.py`: script Python (somente leitura) para ler coils, discrete inputs, input registers e holding registers via Modbus TCP.
- `modbus-outputs.py`: script Python de teste de saídas — coils piscando (3x, 2 s) e PWM varrendo 0–100% em passos de 25% (2 s), com reset ao final.
- `modbus-analog-monitor.py`: script Python que monitora a entrada analógica (ADC/30001) a cada 2 s com timestamp.
